            "review_title": "Review at Noriboi - Omakase Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "liliechat\nFrance628 contributions\n0\nA symphony of flavors in 21 acts\nSep 2026 • Friends\nA symphony in 21 dishes, all absolutely fabulous; the chef is only 24 years old, but he is extraordinarily gifted. The presentation of each dish in itself is a dream. The atmosphere is hushed, soft; it is a communion with the food presented, made from the best ingredients possible! Bravo, and hats off to the artist.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten September 9, 2026",
