            "review_text": "Didier M.\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam120 contributions\n0\nGood but lot of progress to be made for such an expensive experience\nMar 2026 • Couples\nFood is really good, even if extremely expensive for what it is.\nBut service is not at the level of the restaurant and its ambition. 20 minutes waiting under cold AC downstairs without being welcomed, and my 8 months pregnant wife getting a glass of wine to make it up 😆 they knew she was pregnant, a mocktail would have been better. It shows how the staff is junior (but very kind!). Side comment: cutlery is cheap, chopsticks and spoon of street food level, your manager should do his homework and take example on Yuzu omakase service and cutlery. Kind recommendation 😉\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 16, 2026",
