            "review_text": "Trong N\n1 contribution\n0\nAwesome Experience\nDec 2024 • Couples\nVery fortunate that we chose NORIBOI to celebrate our anniversary of all the millions of great places in the city. A+ service. Atmosphere is very zen and pristine. Most importantly, the food was exceptional. \n\nAll the ingredients were so fresh and unique. The dinning experience feels much more elevated due to Chef Công’s extensive knowledge of the ingredients in his dishes. The stories and planned activities are a nice break in between bites that kept the meal engaged rather than the normal dining experience.\n\nOverall, had an absolute blast here, and I would highly recommend NORIBOI to anyone who is familiar with the Omakase dining experience but wants a more Vietnamese inspired flavors.\nRead more\nWritten December 28, 2024",
