            "review_text": "Chris T\n106 contributions\n0\nWonderful Omakase Experience in HCMC\nDec 2024 • Friends\nNoriboi Omakase のり坊い has moved to a stunning new location in D1 on 31 Pho Duc Chinh. The ambiance and décor is delightful and is inspired by the Japanese life nurturing concept of water and in reality feels like you could be on the set of the movie Dune 2. \nThe Vietnamese chefs are talented & engaging while the service is white gloved, attentive with a light touch. The drinks list is comprehensive with a wide range of sake and Japanese tea. The stars of the show are ingredients that showcase world class proteins prepared by the chef’s to accentuate the flavours of the freshly flown in fish. Noriboi is owned by SOKO Cake Bake & Brunch Group so expect “surprise & delight” with the desserts.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 7, 2024",
