            "review_title": "Review at Noriboi - Omakase Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Hai N\n1 contribution\n1\nWorst omakase I have ever experienced\nAug 2024 • Couples\nTrue scam and unethical!\n- all 5 stars reviews are fake\n- few customers but they rushes us \"we are almost full, hurry up!\"\n- extreme cold atmosphere\n- little food that costs 10-15 minutes between dishes but only 30 seconds to eat, most of the time is waiting\n- the main taste of all dishes and even drinks is SOUR, we get burning tongue aftermatch\n- they grate truffle in every dishes, the truffle scent overwhelms all other food.\n- the price is extremely unethical, 8.7 million dong for 2 people with very little food, and we are still VERY HUNGRY aftermatch. There are countless places that serve better food with price 5 times cheaper.\n- lastly, they knew we are not happy but ignore our feelings, like scammers treat people \"figured it out\"\nRead more\nWritten August 25, 2024",
